  "system": {
    "slug": "david-anderson",
    "details": {
      "level": {
        "value": 10
      },
      "publicNotes": "<p>Captain (later Admiral) David Anderson is a decorated Alliance N7 soldier, one of humanity's first Spectres candidates, and a mentor to Commander Shepard. Principled, loyal, and formidably capable in the field, he has served in every major conflict of his era. Anderson fights with the precision of a career soldier and leads with the kind of calm authority that steadies those around him even under fire.</p><p><strong>Inspiring Presence (aura, 30 ft):</strong> Alliance allies within 30 feet gain a +1 morale bonus to attack rolls and saving throws.</p><p><strong>N7 Training:</strong> Anderson has a +1 circumstance bonus to all saving throws from decades of elite military conditioning.</p><p><strong>Kinetic Barrier:</strong> 40 Shield HP. Recharges 12 HP per turn.</p>",
      "privateNotes": "",
      "publication": {
        "title": "Mass Effect Compendium",
